- [ ] FG2-F2: Show/hide word in GamePage based on role
- [ ] FG2-F3: Display drawer/guesser role in Scoreboard
- [ ] FG2-F4: Add polling to GamePage

### Dependencies
- Depends on FG1 complete
- FG2-B1, FG2-B2 first, then FG2-B3-B5
- Frontend after backend

